// Checked, saturating and ordinary arithmetic on int32_t, int64_t match exact math at every boundary pair (a hash of each sweep's results, from an exact oracle). Optimized.
//@ slow
//@ opt: O3
//@ reason: the optimizer must not fold or reorder checked arithmetic on unknown operands
//@ run-pass
//@ revisions: sweep_int32 sweep_int64 ops_int32 ops_int64 overflow_int32_1 overflow_int32_2 overflow_int32_3 overflow_int32_4 overflow_int32_5 overflow_int32_6 overflow_int32_7 overflow_int32_8 overflow_int64_1 overflow_int64_2 overflow_int64_3 overflow_int64_4 overflow_int64_5 overflow_int64_6 overflow_int64_7 overflow_int64_8
